<Base
  title="Movies"
  description="Films Vish recommends — favourites, rewatches, and what's in the queue."
>
  <h1>Movies</h1>
  <p>
    Films I love, films I rewatch, films I'm working through. The bias: I
    want films that respect the audience and earn their endings. Doesn't
    matter if it's a Western, a sci-fi, or a slow Danish thing — what
    matters is the conviction behind the camera and whether the writer
    trusted me to keep up.
  </p>
  <p>
    If you've watched something that fits, send it over:
    <a href="mailto:vishvaddi@gmail.com">vishvaddi@gmail.com</a>. I'm always
    looking for the next one.
  </p>

